## Layout & Spacing

```svelte
<!-- Standard page shell -->
<div class="flex flex-col h-full bg-bg0 text-text0 overflow-y-auto">
  <!-- content -->
</div>
```

- Base spacing unit: `4px` (`gap-1`, `p-1`, etc.)
- Cards inside a page: `p-4` internal padding, `gap-3` between cards
- Section-level spacing: `mb-6` between major sections
- Safe area: **`pb-safe` and `pt-safe` are not configured** — use `pb-8` / `pt-4` as a conservative approximation until a safeArea plugin is added

