## Accent Glow Reference

```
shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(70,33,255,0.3)]    /* blue card glow */
shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(0,200,168,0.3)]    /* teal card glow */
shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(255,203,136,0.3)]  /* amber card glow */
shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(240,113,120,0.3)]  /* red card glow */
shadow-[0_8px_24px_-12px_rgba(70,33,255,0.7)]  /* blue CTA button glow */
```

One glow per screen section maximum. No glow on non-modal blur elements.

